# resmon NEWS

## v1.0.0 (2026-11-01)
First public release.
- Merged xfce4-systemload-plugin 1.3.2 monitors + netload-style network monitor
- Three traffic sources (manual / default-route / sum-all)
- Auto_Max adaptive scale, K/M/G byte or bit rates
- Network placement below/above/left/right; height sharing for 1- and 2-row panels
- Bar width / bar spacing / text spacing all configurable, zero jitter layout
- Live via xfconf; meson build
